<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/16/eng@/~cl_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Subsection 9(4) of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the words “the head of that public authority” the words “, and the Auditor General may make any recommendation to address such irregularities”. New section 9a"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/16/eng@> .
